msgid "Auto keeps route ownership with OpenKill firewall; enable only when Mihomo should install routes itself."
msgstr "自动模式由 OpenKill 防火墙负责路由；仅在需要由 Mihomo 自行安装路由时启用。"

msgid "Automatic (OpenKill firewall)"
msgstr "自动（由 OpenKill 防火墙管理）"

msgid "Mihomo manages routes"
msgstr "由 Mihomo 管理路由"

msgid "Leave automatic to avoid duplicate firewall redirects on older or vendor firmware."
msgstr "建议保持自动，避免旧版或厂商固件重复创建防火墙重定向。"

msgid "Mihomo manages redirect"
msgstr "由 Mihomo 管理重定向"

msgid "Let Mihomo select the active uplink interface; recommended for multi-WAN and IPv6 networks."
msgstr "让 Mihomo 自动选择当前上行接口；适用于多 WAN 和 IPv6 网络。"

msgid "Drop traffic that cannot be resolved through the TUN route. Keep disabled for maximum compatibility."
msgstr "丢弃无法通过 TUN 路由解析的流量；为保证兼容性建议关闭。"

msgid "Adds NAT mapping work; enable only when a UDP application requires endpoint-independent mapping."
msgstr "会增加 NAT 映射开销；仅在 UDP 应用需要端点独立映射时启用。"

msgid "Controller Listen Scope"
msgstr "控制器监听范围"

msgid "LAN address (recommended)"
msgstr "LAN 地址（推荐）"

msgid "LAN binds to the router LAN address; loopback keeps the API local. Avoid exposing the controller on WAN."
msgstr "绑定路由器 LAN 地址；回环地址只允许本机访问。请勿将控制器暴露到 WAN。"

msgid "DNS Listen Address"
msgstr "DNS 监听地址"

msgid "Keep the Mihomo DNS listener on loopback when dnsmasq redirects local queries."
msgstr "使用 dnsmasq 重定向本地查询时，建议将 Mihomo DNS 监听保持在回环地址。"

msgid "Local device only (recommended)"
msgstr "仅本机访问（推荐）"

msgid "Run local-network and IPv6 route maintenance on the first cycle and then at this interval; a larger value lowers background load."
msgstr "首次运行并按此间隔维护本地网络和 IPv6 路由；间隔越大，后台负载越低。"

msgid "Resolve AAAA records through the configured DNS path. Enable only when the router has a working IPv6 route; the local YAML keeps a short IPv6 fallback window."
msgstr "通过配置的 DNS 路径解析 AAAA 记录；仅在路由器 IPv6 路由正常时启用，本地 YAML 会保留较短的 IPv6 回退窗口。"
